{
  "name": "Coaching Institute - Parent Chatbot (WhatsApp + AI)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Parent Chatbot - how it works\nParent messages the institute WhatsApp number -> number is matched to Parent_Phone_1/2 in Students sheet -> n8n (not the AI) pulls that ONE student's rows and calculates the facts -> AI only explains the facts in the parent's language.\n\n**Replace:** YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID, YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID, OWNER_PHONE_91XXXXXXXXXX, YOUR_INSTITUTE_NAME (inside AI Agent system message)\n**Credentials:** Google Sheets OAuth2, WhatsApp API (send nodes), WhatsApp OAuth (trigger), OpenAI (or swap the Chat Model for Gemini/Claude)\n**Template to approve in Meta:** owner_alert (3 variables) - \"Parent alert. Parent: {{1}} ({{2}}). Message: {{3}}\". Then re-pick it in the 2 'Alert Owner' nodes.\n\n**Sheets (exact tab + column names):**\n- Students: Student_ID, Name, Batch, Roll_No, Parent_Phone_1, Parent_Phone_2, Fee_Total, Fee_Paid, Fee_Due_Date, Active (put 91 + number, or plain 10 digits)\n- Attendance: Date (YYYY-MM-DD), Student_ID, Status (P / A)\n- Tests: Date (YYYY-MM-DD), Student_ID, Subject, Test_Name, Marks, Max_Marks\n- Remarks: Date, Student_ID, Teacher, Remark, Type (tab can stay empty)\n- Blocked: Phone, Wrong_Attempts, Blocked_Until\n- Query_Log: Time, Phone, Student_ID, Question, Reply\n\n**Notes:**\n- The AI Agent has NO sheet tools on purpose (privacy). The Calculator tool is only there because some n8n Agent versions demand at least one tool.\n- Siblings: parent must mention the child's first name; bot asks if missing.\n- Only ONE workflow may use the WhatsApp Trigger per Meta app.\n- Test with the Meta test number and fake students first.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 760
      },
      "name": "Setup Notes",
